<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσῐτ-ήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽεἴσειμἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to entrance</i>:
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσιτήρια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά,
				<i>a sacrifice at the beginning</i> of a year or <i>entrance
				on</i> an office, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.190
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. ὑπὲρ τῆς βουλῆς ἱεροποιῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					21.114
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				695.25
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				45.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσιτήριοι θυσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.2
				</span></i>
			 : sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσιτήριον, τό,</span>
			<i>entrance-deposit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				77.37
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσητ</span>-Pap.):— 
				Att.
			 Inscrr. have <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσιτητήρια</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.17
			</span></i>, al.</div>
